  "description": "Asahi Refining combines nearly 200 years of industry experience with forward-looking innovation to deliver world-class precious metal assaying, refining, and bullion products. The company was formed when Japanese precious metals giant Asahi Holdings acquired Johnson Matthey's gold and silver refining business in 2015, bringing together decades of expertise from both organizations. As a London Good Delivery Refiner with facilities including an ISO9001:2015 certified mint in Miami, Florida, Asahi refines the largest amount of precious metals in North America and serves mining, recycling, institutional investment, and distribution sectors globally.",
  "canonical": "https://bulliontradingllc.com/mints/asahi/",
